    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueHaley",
      "key": "Outdoor_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hi, honey! If I knew more about farm work I'd help you out more. Sorry!#$e#I'll be thinking of you.$h",
      "translation": "Ahoj, zlato! Kdybych se lépe vyznala v práci na farmě, pomáhala bych ti víc. Promiň!#$e#Budu na tebe myslet.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "8726b7a075a04e84c1d53b19714ddc7e56d58d907ebe28453d7e60e0ca322cc6",
      "translationSHA256": "e374147872e3eb542cf10f4005d051b192bb1fe259a54d04ff60ee670f7b31a4",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueHaley",
      "key": "Outdoor_3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I'm just going to do some dusting over here. That should help you out, right?#$e#*phew*... it's hot out here.",
      "translation": "Tady trochu utřu prach. To ti pomůže, že?#$e#*uf*... Tady venku je horko.",
      "sourceSHA256": "a4b496948daaf68390963c3718bf5088715be4e21cffbc26c342d1cb48b75fa1",
      "translationSHA256": "824d81552ade2c5ef2c132f72f4ce9b3744513094b2ab2d29da886b28d20ff10",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueHaley",
      "key": "Outdoor_4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Don't overwork yourself, dear.#$e#Make sure and take a break every now and then, or get something to eat.$h",
      "translation": "Nepřepracuj se, drahoušku.#$e#Nezapomeň si čas od času odpočinout nebo něco sníst.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "40ba86471899999f1e0c9df6d5c41e0d4581a3b8455e648af940b60474442347",
      "translationSHA256": "5c82960d7fdccead0b62844c375f7e241830d72e6f938b6d6fe2ceb1e7a25fe3",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueHaley",
      "key": "Outdoor_Haley",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Looks like a good day to work on my tan, don't you think, sweetheart?",
      "translation": "Dnešek vypadá jako ideální den na opalování, nemyslíš, zlato?",
      "sourceSHA256": "e644e5f97c5db654122ab29f8fe04962fb97ecfbf39f7909d5620fe2b4647dfc",
      "translationSHA256": "0e5aa3a37521163d750f83f811216a2ae935dfed569d6a7dc7fa87a72bf0c83b",
      "reviewChecks": [
