    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueHaley",
      "key": "fall_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Fall is kind of sad for me... everything is dying.$5",
      "translation": "Podzim je pro mě trochu smutný... Všechno umírá.$5",
      "sourceSHA256": "c5ef0330d72ab6deaacaacd59eed5f708b739df0cdbd5ef2790bc85c45cedf87",
      "translationSHA256": "257c4eb30b7fe4db6deb1518544bfd94cf06b82ca0f927b5b9ca58e582bc2820",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueHaley",
      "key": "winter_14",
      "field": null,
      "source": "My skin feels so dry in this weather.",
      "translation": "V tomhle počasí mám tak suchou pokožku.",
      "sourceSHA256": "22d6e3e49cd92767c7fd5ef1653c1f1902a3f4bccd738cf0f562f0cb402e56bc",
      "translationSHA256": "c9fcd3df138da8ab4c25d4598cd8ba5a48b365d3516ddab63e5a9d6ee505ba94",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueHaley",
      "key": "winter_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "For some reason, the snowy weather gives me cravings for pink cake...",
      "translation": "Z nějakého důvodu dostávám za sněžného počasí chuť na růžový dort...",
      "sourceSHA256": "69fe04a43346f7d42c4a8276a9dd2446eac475158de35567ffac83a89c1fc5c6",
      "translationSHA256": "f2184b454f8211967c3f32235fcc0e73b255e19422f7c3a40c5590ed5ca63151",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueHaley",
      "key": "spring_Haley",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Aren't you glad winter's over, honey? Things seem more hopeful now.",
      "translation": "Také máš radost, že zima skončila, zlato? Teď všechno působí nadějněji.",
      "sourceSHA256": "2c72d61a7ef6b8aa2461ae2eebd5129baeff00652e07fa25424852131caa5554",
      "translationSHA256": "b01a32acb7f765d3706c8875ec3583d02c78686cec352e1a728b5233fc433efd",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueHaley",
      "key": "summer_Haley",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I love watching the fireflies on a hot summer's night. It's the closest I'll ever come to visiting the stars.",
      "translation": "Miluji pozorování světlušek za horkých letních nocí. Blíž ke hvězdám se asi nikdy nepodívám.",
      "sourceSHA256": "8ec050bbb829670c848a21a5e506d7199d5a4f4a536bf32db61e2ddb4244400d",
      "translationSHA256": "1e30cda1dfe7f42e35e55f2710e3cf82fc28336342aa79288435a05fd19c1eff",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueHaley",
      "key": "fall_Haley",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Even though I prefer summer, fall might be the best season to take pictures. Those long, low shadows...",
      "translation": "I když mám raději léto, podzim je možná nejlepší období na fotografování. Ty dlouhé, nízké stíny...",
      "sourceSHA256": "dd8b1d99989cf37acf002d8b82ba83edaa2e8d620199903b1130c211ce49ad9c",
      "translationSHA256": "c0993d37cea31a4e88f7a00acfba5efc98381eab4317ec4a314e10411085d9df",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueHaley",
      "key": "winter_Haley",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I was just thinking about the time you helped me open a jar of pickles. Remember that?$h#$e#We've come a long way since then.$l",
      "translation": "Zrovna jsem přemýšlela o tom, jak se mi s tvou pomocí podařilo otevřít sklenici nakládaných okurek. Vzpomínáš?$h#$e#Od té doby jsme urazili dlouhou cestu.$l",
      "sourceSHA256": "e4bfe43f52673f6b7207c3307e4162e98754f030dec3cd6f0e574f439a64d6f8",
      "translationSHA256": "e8c9f9b8036efcdabfb5ca876e28c5143fa1c94330444f35c6f0f760a603f977",
